{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "zero divisors in the sedenions:\n  (e1 - e10)(e4 + e15) = 0, although |e1 - e10| = |e4 + e15| = sqrt(2)\n  so |ab| = |a||b| fails and the sedenions are not a division algebra (from dimension 16 on, every Cayley-Dickson algebra has them)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "zerodivisors mod 12", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": [], "understood": false, "results": [{"kind": "zerodivisors", "headline": "zero divisors in the sedenions:", "details": ["(e1 - e10)(e4 + e15) = 0, although |e1 - e10| = |e4 + e15| = sqrt(2)", "so |ab| = |a||b| fails and the sedenions are not a division algebra (from dimension 16 on, every Cayley-Dickson algebra has them)"]}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "zero divisors in the sedenions:\n  (e1 - e10)(e4 + e15) = 0, although |e1 - e10| = |e4 + e15| = sqrt(2)\n  so |ab| = |a||b| fails and the sedenions are not a division algebra (from dimension 16 on, every Cayley-Dickson algebra has them)\n"}, "isError": false}}
